  title="Moving with Kids in Denver: A Family's Guide to Staying Calm and Organized | Legacy Moving Denver"
  description="Moving with children adds a layer of complexity that most moving guides skip over entirely. Here's a practical, experience-based guide to keeping your family calm, organized, and together through a Denver move."
>
